  <h2>Donor data</h2>
  <p>
    When the hosted service is live, donor details entered through a charity's
    widget are processed on that charity's behalf. The charity is the controller
    and SatsRecord the processor. Details are encrypted at rest, exportable by
    the charity, and deletable on request.
  </p>
